                                "sense_id": "b7c526fe-e817-35f5-939f-568b03498b53",
                                "text": "Since 2008, in response to a presidential memorandum that replaced SBU information with \"controlled unclassified information (CUI) as the single categorical designation for SBU infoemation, the executive branch is attempting to overhaul its CUI framework."
